[{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_04_0010","text":"（这次的演唱会……\n　虽然也有期待的声音————）"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_04_9900","text":"SNS的帖子"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_04_0020","text":"————『希望CoMETIK解散』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_04_9901","text":"SNS的帖子"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_04_0030","text":"『那两个人不存在比较好』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_04_9902","text":"SNS的帖子"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_04_0040","text":"『无论是角色还是技术\n　都和那两位差太多了吧』"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_04_0050","text":"感觉这次的舞蹈，\n我慢慢找到感觉了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_04_0060","text":"一开始觉得节奏很难\n但可能是习惯了吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_04_0070","text":"这样的话，也许能让大家大吃一惊呢……呵呵\n粉丝们也是————……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_04_0071","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_04_0080","text":"嗯？　阳希？\n怎么了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_04_0090","text":"羽那……你看了SNS……了吗……？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_04_0091","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_04_0093","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_04_0092","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_04_0100","text":"阳希，你怎么了？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_04_0110","text":"从房间里……传来说话声……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_04_0120","text":"关于对CoMETIK的批评意见，\n这边也有掌握"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_04_0130","text":"负面的东西，\n一直以来都多少会有的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_04_0140","text":"看吧————————……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_04_0150","text":"好事什么的，一件都没有……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_04_0160","text":"怎么样？\n搞这种东西，后悔了吧"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_04_0170","text":"……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_04_0180","text":"说放弃啊……\n情况不妙就放弃吧……你们这些人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_04_9903","text":"经纪人"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_04_0190","text":"所以，这次……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_04_0191","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_04_0200","text":"啊哈哈————————\n对，这样就对了……到此为止了"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_04_0201","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_04_0210","text":"要放弃了吧……就这样…………"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_04_0221","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_04_0222","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_04_0220","text":"…………不————"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s01_08030000_04_0230","text":"啊……？"}]
